---
description: Kotlin style
alwaysApply: true
---

Use modern Kotlin.

Prefer:
- data class
- sealed interface
- value class when appropriate
- extension functions
- StateFlow over LiveData
- Coroutines
- Flow

Avoid:
- GlobalScope
- nullable types unless necessary
- lateinit unless required
- !! operator

Prefer immutable objects.
Functions should be short and have a single responsibility.
Use meaningful names.
Follow official Kotlin coding conventions.
